!!<*yamlover: $defs: chapter>
Containers
description: block or flow in text, K&R for the switch, a directory or a file of their own
- |
  A container picks a **collection style** — block over many lines, flow on one — and,
  on the storage axis, may leave the text entirely: a whole file, or a directory. A flow
  token that *spans* lines is neither style: it is the inline language switch.
- *: block
- *: flow
- *: knr
- *: directory
- *: own-file
